      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow6:139",
        "answer": "Takes a model root and hostname string, reads the clantag child/value, passes it to StringAsClanTag, concatenates the supplied hostname and returns the result. There is no nil/type check or escaping step in this body; the formatter and native model behavior remain separate providers. Takes a color key, controller and third formal argument; asks GetColorBlindColorForPlayer(controller, key). A truthy result is expanded by ExplodeColor and returned with its full return arity. Otherwise returns the literal triple 0,0,0. The third formal is unused, and extra caller-supplied base-color components are not used as a fallback by the shown source. Copies the client number, returns numbertouint64(INVALID_XUID) when it equals INVALID_CLIENT_INDEX or is at least MAX_CLIENTS; otherwise calls getlobbyxuidforclientnum with lobby_module_client, that module's controlling lobby session and the original arg [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
